ngs natural light into the heart of the home. Offering 4 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, the layout includes closet organizers and a FULLY FINISHED BASEMENT with a spacious recreation room and bar. Set on an impressive 737 SQM LOT, the fenced west-facing yard is surrounded by mature trees and offers plenty of room to relax, garden or entertain. An OVERSIZED DOUBLE ATTACHED GARAGE and rear lane access add valuable flexibility. Important updates include a newer roof, updated windows and a furnace replaced in 2014. Located near Southgate LRT, Southgate Centre, the University of Alberta, schools and major commuter routes, this is a rare opportunity to own an original mid-century home in one of south Edmonton’s most established neighbourhoods. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$525,000"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,481 sq ft"],["Lot size","7,940 sq ft"],["Year built","1965"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Lendrum Place"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6H3M6"],["MLS® number","E4514717"],["Listed","October 29, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan, Fan"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.88 m × 4.46 m (19'3\" × 14'8\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.79 m × 3.83 m (9'2\" × 12'7\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.50 m × 3.83 m (14'9\" × 12'7\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.19 m × 3.54 m (13'9\" × 11'7\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.28 m × 3.00 m (10'9\" × 9'10\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","3.28 m × 4.26 m (10'9\" × 14'0\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","3.84 m × 4.68 m (12'7\" × 15'4\")"],["Laundry room","Basement","2.85 m × 2.45 m (9'4\" × 8'0\")"],["Utility room","Basement","4.25 m × 4.81 m (13'11\" × 15'9\")"]],"courtesy":"David Ozubko, Real Broker and Maria Ozubko, Real Broker","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","t